{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:750e3fbfd9555e8e","name":"Multispectrum Searchlight","source":{"id":"source:reference-750e3fbfd9555e8e","title":"Multispectrum Searchlight","revision":21078,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:07:23Z","sha256":"9fd2b747b0461bf31b5d031bf06d76e07a9c94937c6bffcc3d1fb40207669ff9","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21078","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Multispectrum%20Searchlight&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-750e3fbfd9555e8e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 100\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This handheld or installed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Accessory"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Accessory"}," is a powerful spotlight that shines visible, infrared, or ultraviolet light. It has a 6-km range and is powered by the Droid's own internal power supply. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," able to see the projected light gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Search"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Search"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Notice Targets"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Notice_Targets"}," and to other situations in which the Gamemaster judges that the light provides an advantage. This bonus stacks with bonuses granted by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Helmet Packages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Helmet_Packages"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Sensor Packages"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Sensor_Packages"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The light can also be used to blind targets in a 6-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cone"},". All targets within the cone receive a -10 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," makes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against each target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},". If the attack is successful, the target receives a -5 penalty to attack rolls, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks, and other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," until the end of the Droid's next turn. If the attack does not exceed a target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", the target receives a -2 penalty instead. This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Accessory"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Accessory"}," can be used only by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," of Tiny size or larger.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
